  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WASH response to Cholera in Lebanon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The key objective of this project is to prevent the further spread of Cholera in Lebanon through the containment of outbreaks and the provision of sufficient clean and safe water and treatment of waste water. The expected impact is a significant reduction in the number of Cholera cases in the country. This project targets 600,000 affected people with WASH activities.</narrative>
  </description>
